=== edge-of-autumn-fetches-basic
title: Edge of Autumn cast with four or fewer lands fetches a basic land tapped
ref: Edge of Autumn Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Edge of Autumn
  humanbattlefield=Forest;Forest
  humanlibrary=Swamp;Island;Island
script:
  p1: cast Edge of Autumn
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick Swamp
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield count "Swamp" == 1
  tapped p1 "Swamp"

=== edge-of-autumn-five-lands-no-fetch
title: Edge of Autumn does nothing when you control five lands
ref: Edge of Autumn Oracle (intervening if is not used, it checks on resolution)
state:
  humanhand=Edge of Autumn
  humanbattlefield=Forest;Forest;Forest;Forest;Forest
  humanlibrary=Swamp;Island;Island
script:
  p1: cast Edge of Autumn
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  zone p1 battlefield count "Swamp" == 0

=== edge-of-autumn-cycling-sacrifices-land
