=== consider-surveils-then-draws
title: Consider surveils 1 (here binning the top card) then draws the next card
ref: Consider Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Consider
  humanbattlefield=Island
  humanlibrary=Dark Ritual;Brainstorm;Island
script:
  p1: cast Consider
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick Dark Ritual
expect:
  zone p1 graveyard has "Dark Ritual"
  zone p1 hand has "Brainstorm"

=== reanimate-loses-life-equal-to-mana-value
title: Reanimate returns a creature from a graveyard and its controller loses life equal to its mana value (Griselbrand, 8)
ref: Reanimate Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Reanimate
  humanbattlefield=Swamp
  humangraveyard=Griselbrand
script:
  p1: cast Reanimate -> Griselbrand
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  controls p1 "Griselbrand"
  life p1 == 12

=== reanimate-opponents-graveyard
title: Reanimate can take a creature from the opponent's graveyard and puts it under your control
ref: Reanimate Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Reanimate
  humanbattlefield=Swamp
  aigraveyard=Atraxa, Grand Unifier
script:
  p1: cast Reanimate -> Atraxa, Grand Unifier
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick none
expect:
  controls p1 "Atraxa, Grand Unifier"
  life p1 == 13

=== reanimate-fizzles-to-surgical-extraction
title: Surgical Extraction (paid with 2 life) exiling the target in response makes Reanimate fizzle: no life lost to Reanimate
ref: Reanimate Oracle; Surgical Extraction Oracle; CR 608.2b
state:
  humanhand=Reanimate
  humanbattlefield=Swamp
  humangraveyard=Griselbrand
  aihand=Surgical Extraction
script:
  p1: cast Reanimate -> Griselbrand
  p1: pass
  p2: when-stack Reanimate
  p2: cast Surgical Extraction -> Griselbrand
expect:
  life p1 == 20
  zone p1 exile has "Griselbrand"
  not controls p1 "Griselbrand"
  life p2 == 18

=== animate-dead-minus-one-power
title: Animate Dead returns the creature with -1/-0 (Griselbrand becomes 6/7)
ref: Animate Dead Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Animate Dead
  humanbattlefield=Swamp;Swamp
  humangraveyard=Griselbrand
script:
  p1: cast Animate Dead -> Griselbrand
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  controls p1 "Griselbrand"
  pt p1 "Griselbrand" 6/7
  life p1 == 20

=== animate-dead-leaves-sacrifices-creature
title: When Animate Dead leaves the battlefield (destroyed by Witch Enchanter), the reanimated creature is sacrificed
ref: Animate Dead Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Animate Dead
  humanbattlefield=Swamp;Swamp
  humangraveyard=Griselbrand
  aihand=Witch Enchanter
  aibattlefield=Plains;Plains;Plains;Plains
script:
  p1: cast Animate Dead -> Griselbrand
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p2: at p2:MAIN1
  p2: cast Witch Enchanter
  p2: pass
  p1: pass
  p2: pick Animate Dead
expect:
  zone p1 graveyard has "Griselbrand"
  zone p1 graveyard has "Animate Dead"
  not controls p1 "Griselbrand"

=== shallow-grave-returns-top-creature-with-haste
title: Shallow Grave returns the topmost creature card of the graveyard with haste, exiled at the next end step
ref: Shallow Grave Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Shallow Grave
  humanbattlefield=Swamp;Swamp
  humangraveyard=Atraxa, Grand Unifier;Griselbrand
script:
  p1: cast Shallow Grave
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: at END_OF_TURN
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  zone p1 exile has "Griselbrand"
  zone p1 graveyard has "Atraxa, Grand Unifier"

=== unmask-alt-cost-exiles-black-card
title: Unmask can be cast by exiling a black card from hand, and the caster picks a nonland card to discard
ref: Unmask Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Unmask;Dark Ritual
  aihand=Swords to Plowshares;Island
script:
  p1: cast Unmask ~alt -> p2
  p1: pick Dark Ritual
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick Swords to Plowshares
expect:
  zone p1 exile has "Dark Ritual"
  zone p2 graveyard has "Swords to Plowshares"

=== unmask-cannot-pitch-nonblack
title: Unmask's alternative cost needs a black card: a red card cannot be exiled
ref: Unmask Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Unmask;Lightning Bolt
  aihand=Swords to Plowshares
script:
  p1: try cast Unmask ~alt -> p2
  p1: pass
expect:
  zone p1 hand has "Unmask"
  zone p1 hand has "Lightning Bolt"

=== faithless-looting-draw-discard-and-flashback
title: Faithless Looting draws two and discards two, then can be flashed back from the graveyard for {2}{R}
ref: Faithless Looting Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Faithless Looting;Island;Island
  humanbattlefield=Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain;Mountain
  humanlibrary=Brainstorm;Ponder;Island;Island
script:
  p1: cast Faithless Looting
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick Island;Island
  p1: cast Faithless Looting ~alt
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick Brainstorm;Ponder
expect:
  zone p1 exile has "Faithless Looting"
  zone p1 graveyard has "Ponder"

=== cabal-therapy-names-card
title: Cabal Therapy discards every copy of the named card from the opponent's hand
ref: Cabal Therapy Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Cabal Therapy
  humanbattlefield=Swamp
  aihand=Swords to Plowshares;Swords to Plowshares;Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
script:
  p1: cast Cabal Therapy -> p2
  p1: pick Swords to Plowshares
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  zone p2 graveyard count "Swords to Plowshares" == 2
  zone p2 hand has "Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd"

=== cabal-therapy-flashback-sacrifice
title: Cabal Therapy can be flashed back by sacrificing a creature
ref: Cabal Therapy Oracle
state:
  humangraveyard=Cabal Therapy
  humanbattlefield=Ocelot Pride
  aihand=Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
script:
