=== griselbrand-cannot-pay-with-too-little-life
title: Griselbrand's ability cannot be activated at 6 life
ref: Griselbrand Oracle; CR 119.4
state:
  humanlife=6
  humanbattlefield=Griselbrand
script:
  p1: try activate Griselbrand
  p1: pass
expect:
  life p1 == 6
  zone p1 hand size == 0

=== archon-of-cruelty-etb
title: Archon of Cruelty's trigger makes the opponent sacrifice, discard and lose 3, while the controller draws and gains 3
ref: Archon of Cruelty Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Archon of Cruelty
  humanlibrary=Island;Island
  aihand=Swords to Plowshares
  aibattlefield=Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
script:
  p1: at COMBAT_BEGIN
  p1: attack Archon of Cruelty -> p2
  p1: pick p2
expect:
  life p2 == 17
  life p1 == 23
  zone p2 graveyard has "Swords to Plowshares"
  zone p2 graveyard has "Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd"
  zone p1 hand size == 1

=== raph-and-mikey-attack-trigger
title: Raph and Mikey puts the first creature revealed from the library onto the battlefield tapped and attacking
ref: Raph & Mikey, Troublemakers Oracle
state:
  humanbattlefield=Raph & Mikey, Troublemakers
  humanlibrary=Island;Lotus Petal;Griselbrand;Island
script:
  p1: at COMBAT_BEGIN
  p1: attack Raph & Mikey, Troublemakers -> p2
  p1: at COMBAT_DAMAGE
  p1: check controls p1 "Griselbrand"
  p1: pass
expect:
  controls p1 "Griselbrand"
  zone p1 library size == 3

=== stronghold-gambit-lowest-creature-enters
title: Stronghold Gambit puts the creature with the lowest mana value revealed onto the battlefield; both players reveal
ref: Stronghold Gambit Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Stronghold Gambit;Griselbrand;Island
  humanbattlefield=Mountain;Island
  aihand=Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
script:
  p1: cast Stronghold Gambit
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick Griselbrand
  p2: pick Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
expect:
  controls p2 "Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd"
  not controls p1 "Griselbrand"

=== stronghold-gambit-noncreature-reveals-nothing
title: Stronghold Gambit: a player who reveals a noncreature card puts nothing onto the battlefield
ref: Stronghold Gambit Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Stronghold Gambit;Island
  humanbattlefield=Mountain;Island
  aihand=Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd;Swords to Plowshares
script:
  p1: cast Stronghold Gambit
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
  p1: pick Island
  p2: pick Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
expect:
  controls p2 "Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd"

=== collective-brutality-escalate-two-modes
title: Collective Brutality with one discard (escalate) chooses two modes: opponent loses 2, I gain 2, and -2/-2 on a creature
ref: Collective Brutality Oracle
state:
  humanhand=Collective Brutality;Island
  humanbattlefield=Swamp;Swamp
  aibattlefield=Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd
script:
  p1: cast Collective Brutality -> Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd | p2
  p1: pick Target creature gets;Target opponent loses
  p1: pick Island
  p1: pass
  p2: pass
expect:
  life p2 == 18
  life p1 == 22
  zone p2 graveyard has "Phelia, Exuberant Shepherd"
  zone p1 graveyard has "Island"
